                "text": "CT families are scared. The stories are devastating\u2013 a single father concerned about his twins with autism losing their care & many worried they can't keep up with the cost of their medication.\n\nMedicaid is more than just health care & I\u2019m fighting to save it. https://t.co/vEESSnMc4a",
